pletely soured him on miller and his  lack of loyalty to the belt and he tells  his people to space him he's saved at  the last minute by his co-worker octavia  who kills dawes's guys before the  airlock opens  miller checks the data cube that he got  from julie's place and learns that  there's a bio weapon being developed on  phoebe based on that he comes up with  the theory that julie knew about the bio  weapon and took that information to  dawes he sent her to retrieve the weapon  for the opa because they think they  could buy the belter's independence with  it then she disappeared and he believes  it has something to do with the people  who are making the weapon and that they  also blew up the canterbury making it  look like mars did as a diversion to  draw any potential attention away from  them when he goes to work when he tells  his boss at star helix she just fires  him she locks him out of the system  takes away his credentials and he takes  that to mean that dawes got to her  before he came back none of this stops  miller though and in fact hitting the  slow spot just clarifies things he's  been obsessed with julie's case for a  while dawes implied that he was in love  with julie and don't forget he's never  met the girl and now it's to the point  where he sees this as the thing that  might be able to save him it's really  all he has left he gets a message from  his old friend sematimba who he asked to  look into the anubis he said that it  never arrived on eros but one of its  shuttles did and the anubis 1a is still  there miller decides to leave and you  see him cash in his bribes in the former  casino chips which are the only way to  pass money under the radar everything  else is digital and then he books  passage on a transport  avasarala goes to the family farm in  montana to try to learn about james  holden in this period of time it's not  easy to have children on earth because  of restrictions and holden has eight  parents who all contributed dna an